  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.7.0-preview.3\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Add reminder notification config, update correspondence contract by @HauklandJ in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1345\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Optionally include binary attachments in instance copy operation by @adamhaeger in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1358\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* update version by @HauklandJ in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1346\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies by @renovate in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1071\n* Update dependency Verify.Xunit to v30 by @renovate in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1296\n* Update mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:8.0-alpine Docker digest to 26a8e9c by @renovate in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1316\n* Update dependency Swashbuckle.AspNetCore to v9 by @renovate in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1351\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.7.0-preview.2...v8.7.0-preview.3",
